        <p class="lead" style="color:var(--bad);font-style:italic">B2C costs, investment after year 5 and end-of-life replacement are not included (see the Strategy and Cash flow notes).</p></div></article>

      <details class="more" style="margin-top:14px"><summary>Standard business model canvas layout</summary>
      <div class="bmc">
        <div class="blk b-kp"><h3><span class="ic">8</span>Key partners</h3><ul>
          <li>Participating utilities under common core conditions</li><li>Regional delivery packages: supply, installation, maintenance</li><li>Existing licensed bank (account-control mandate)</li><li>Government funding and policy counterparts</li><li>Independent regulators, NEMSA, verification</li><li>Vending channels and telcos for USSD and SMS</li><li>Community organisations: explain and test, not approve</li></ul></div>
