          <li>No upfront meter payment</li><li>Clear explanation of what charges cover</li><li>A functioning meter, verified at commissioning</li><li>One contact for appointments, faults, complaints</li><li>Visible repair process, accountable maintainer</li><li>Protection against duplicate meter charges</li><li>No smartphone or credit score needed</li></ul>
          <p class="lead" style="margin-top:8px">Differentiation: simple access, payment transparency and maintained service, combined.</p></div>
        <div class="blk b-cr"><h3><span class="ic">4</span>Customer relationships</h3><ul>
          <li>Meter Service Coordinator, first contact to replacement</li><li>Explanation at commissioning</li><li>Trust measured by understanding, resolved problems, working service</li><li>Supportive reminders only; no pressure or overspending rewards</li></ul></div>
        <div class="blk b-ch"><h3><span class="ic">3</span>Channels</h3><ul>
          <li>Understand: demonstrations, radio, SMS, community groups</li><li>Register: assisted desk, phone, agents, digital</li><li>Updates: SMS or phone</li><li>Pay: existing vending channels</li><li>Faults: one contact, case reference</li></ul></div>
        <div class="blk b-cs"><h3><span class="ic">1</span>Customer segments</h3><ul>
          <li>Unmetered, low-income households</li><li>Other unmetered households</li><li>Tenants and shared properties</li><li>Households with faulty or obsolete meters</li><li>Rural and hard-to-reach households</li><li>Later: small businesses, assessed separately</li></ul></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bmc2">
